; A reduction is booked as one posting per lot, each with the price its
; posting leaves out. Against two lots that is two missing numbers, which
; beancount cannot interpolate; against one lot it is one, and a price is
; never inferred for units held at cost. Both are reported on the posting.
option "booking_method" "HIFO"

2020-01-01 open Assets:Stock
2020-01-01 open Assets:Cash

2020-01-02 * "two lots"
  Assets:Stock  10 HOOL {10 USD}
  Assets:Stock   1 HOOL {20 USD}
  Assets:Cash  -120 USD

2020-02-01 * "a reduction over both lots, its price left out"
  Assets:Stock  -3 HOOL {} @ USD
  Assets:Cash   40 USD

2020-02-02 * "a reduction of one lot, its price left out"
  Assets:Stock  -1 HOOL {} @ USD
  Assets:Cash   10 USD
